hical is a modern C++20 web framework. To use it in your CMake project:

    find_package(hical CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE hical::hical_core)

hical requires Boost (asio, beast, system, json) and OpenSSL to be available.
Make sure your project's CMakeLists.txt also calls find_package for these if needed.
